# Walkthrough: UI Abstraction Layer Implementation

**Date**: 2026-02-11  
**Objective**: Create [src/ui/index.ts](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/ui/index.ts) as single source of truth for UI components to solve TypeScript stack overflow and optimize bundle size for low-end devices.

---

## What Was Accomplished

### 1. Created UI Abstraction Layer ([src/ui/index.ts](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/ui/index.ts))

Created a new abstraction layer that imports directly from Gluestack UI's component modules instead of the aggregate index.

**Pattern Used**:
```typescript
// Direct imports (bypasses aggregate index)
export { Box } from '@gluestack-ui/themed/build/components/Box';
export { Spinner } from '@gluestack-ui/themed/build/components/Spinner';
```

**Components Added**:
- Layout: [Box](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/__tests__/steps/auth_refinement.steps.tsx#66-67), [Center](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/__tests__/steps/auth_refinement.steps.tsx#88-89), [HStack](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/__tests__/steps/invitation_welcome.steps.tsx#43-44), [VStack](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/__tests__/steps/auth_refinement.steps.tsx#64-65), [View](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/__tests__/steps/auth_refinement.steps.tsx#90-91), [ScrollView](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/__tests__/steps/auth_refinement.steps.tsx#90-91), [Pressable](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/__tests__/steps/auth_refinement.steps.tsx#89-90)
- Loading: [Spinner](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/__tests__/steps/auth_refinement.steps.tsx#85-86)
- Toast: [Toast](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/__tests__/steps/auth_refinement.steps.tsx#86-87), [ToastTitle](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/__tests__/steps/auth_refinement.steps.tsx#87-88), `ToastDescription`, [useToast](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/__tests__/steps/auth_refinement.steps.tsx#83-84)
